      "source": "This stream receives a completion or error signal when the connection\nis closed. In a typical <a href=\"../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a> implementation this\nstream is composed into the overall processing flow, so that when the\nconnection is closed, handling will end.",
      "translation": "该流在连接关闭时接收完成或错误信号。在典型的 <a href=\"../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a> 实现中，此流被组合到整体处理流程中，以便在连接关闭时结束处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
